%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 54d651f1419748578d179a096d503338, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialSequence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialSequence
  sequenceId: first_session
  steps:
  - stepId: 0
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 1
    text: Hello, Manager! I am Tasha, a Guild Inspector. You can think of me as a
      kingdom-assigned supervisor. I'm gonna help you make the first steps in establishing
      your guild and ensure everything that happens here is legal, politically correct,
      and follows the code of the hero's union.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 77c31e1062b50744c84218f610ed04c7, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 0
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 1
    allowedActions: 13000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 1
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 0
    text: First of all, let's get familiar with the hunters in your guild. For now,
      you only have one - Mara Vell. She is your first, but definitely not the last.
      Approach and talk to her.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f070ffbe82ba714428968ad3ae478703, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 2
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 0100000008000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 2
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 0
    text: You can access the full list of your hunters, their stats, traits, status,
      and how much upkeep you're paying them from the War Table's "Hunters" tab.
      Additionally, whenever they get enough experience, you can level them up there,
      increasing their power, as well as their upkeep. Grade rises - the salary rises
      as well. Fair and square.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb22a4594c3457644a3a32cbd1879d95, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 5
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 0200000004000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 3
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 1
    text: You have hunters, you have a guild - now it's time to receive your first
      order. Folks from all around will visit your guild and tell you about the problem
      they have with the monsters. Your job is to determine which monster it is exactly,
      asking as many questions as you need to narrow your selection. Ring the bell
      - call for your first client.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca61d3dbf336c8141a9a4f49e00c7d05, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 8
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 06000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 11400000, guid: becfe295d9c8eb846aea7ed2d459d10f, type: 2}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 4
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 0
    text: Approach the client and talk to them. Remember that each question asked,
      as well as other actions in the guild, consumes time. The less time you spend
      asking, the more orders you can take per day, and the more money you will make
      to upgrade, hire, and pay your hunters. A truly skilled monster hunter is the
      one who can determine a monster with just a few questions.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 14bc79a973270c641b5ae1214dddd4cc, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 11
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 0700000008000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 5
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 0
    text: Now, when the questions are asked, you need to declare the monster. Press
      the "View order" button, and then, in the order preview, press the "Choose
      a monster" button. The bestiary will be revealed, where all the monsters currently
      disturbing the kingdom appear. Using the clues that you gathered from the questions
      asked, decide which monster this is.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de83d6356e71eaa4986c8fbac561bea5, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 12
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 0800000009000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 6
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 0
    text: After the monster is declared, you can either accept the order and eventually
      complete it, or refer an order to another guild. Referring only gives you a
      small fee as a reward, but you aren't risking wounding your hunters. You can
      also decline the order or return to the questionnaire if you need more information.
      For now, let's accept this order.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1f15a81c34bc1547bbbb508fef5cdcb, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 13
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 08000000090000000a000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 7
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 1
    text: Order accepted. The client leaves, and you are left with a task waiting
      for you in the War Table's "Orders" tab. Approach the table, interact with
      it, open the tab, and see it yourself. You will only get paid when the order
      is completed - the kingdom's treasury will deal with it.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dfe2d5a9848fc324eb064c255e86af78, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 3
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 0200000003000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 8
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 0
    text: Now that the order is in your list, you can send hunters to complete it.
      All the orders will be stored here, where you can access the information about
      them. Select the only order we have for now and assign Mara to it by dragging
      her portrait into an empty party slot or by pressing the "Autofill" button.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: daaf9b5ea9c3eb04988e801d84585ac8, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 14
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 02000000030000000d000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 9
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 0
    text: Hunter is assigned, and now you can see your chances of completing this
      order. Remember that the success rate is calculated against the monster you
      declared - if you were wrong, you might get false information. Click the "Send
      Party" button to send your party on that order.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8d6375544ab7a7942828bc690fd809cc, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 15
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 02000000030000000d0000000e000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 10
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 1
    text: While the hunters are away, you have spare time to attend to the Guild's
      needs. In the future, you will have enough routine to fill that free time -
      clean the floors, change bedsheets, cook meals, chase mimics, and construct
      new facilities. But before this time came, let's just sit, relax, and wait
      for your hunters to return.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6f5c183289033e441a995987bfe44969, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 16
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 0f000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 1
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 11
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 1
    text: Your party is back, and you can see the Report Panel upon their return.
      Here you will find out if the assignment ended in success or failure, how much
      gold and experience you acquired, and whether your declared monster was true
      or false. This panel is purely informational, so you can close it whenever
      you want.
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 385dd327f4be37b4ea19954c21e6b0f5, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 17
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 10000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 0
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 0
    forceHiringAdFree: 0
  - stepId: 12
    speakerName: Tasha
    speakerMood: 1
    text: 'While Mara handled the first order alone, other orders might not be that
      easy. You need to hire more hunters to your guild before I let you go on your
      own. I recommend having at least 3 hunters. Approach the War Table, choose
      the Hiring tab, and post a recruitment advertisement to hire more hunters.
      Once they see the ad, they will enter the guild and approach you. Don''t worry,
      the kingdom will pay for your first ad.

      For now, you are on your own.
      Keep receiving clients and sending hunters on orders.'
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 23b0099b971687b4e8f6684e8100cea1, type: 3}
    completionEvent: 18
    customCompletionEvent: 
    requiredEventCount: 0
    allowManualContinue: 0
    allowedActions: 0200000005000000110000001200000013000000
    allowedActionIds: []
    forcedOrder: {fileID: 0}
    forcePassTimeToFirstActiveMissionRemaining: 0
    forcedMonsterSelection: {fileID: 0}
    forceHiringAdDuration: 1
    forcedHiringAdDurationSeconds: 1
    forceHiringAdFree: 1
